u, they finished the job in 3 days. What is the amount to be paid to Chintu?", "options": [{"text": "Rs.580", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.520", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.450", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.400", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "wages", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "A person rows a boat 11 km in 5 hours downstream and returns upstream in 7 hours. What is the speed of the stream in km/h?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Boats-Streams", "sub": "still-water-and-stream-speed", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "176", "added": false}, {"text": "168", "added": false}, {"text": "152", "added": false}, {"text": "161", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Trigonometry", "sub": "identities", "key_answer": null}]}